<div class="w-full bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900">
  <div class="min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path>
          </svg>
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl sm:tracking-tight lg:text-6xl">
          Tree pickup details
        </h1>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8">Scout Troops 1564 & 1804</h2>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          Bainbridge Island BSA Troops 1564 for boys and 1804 for girls holds its Christmas tree recycling fundraiser every year to support our programs, assisting Scouts in learning leadership, citizenship, and outdoor skills, attending camps, and other adventures. This fundraiser is run by the Scouts from our Troops, who are directly involved in picking up the trees and arranging for them to be recycled by composting. To learn more about our Troops, please visit our Facebook page.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8">On the day of pickup</h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <%= setting.on_day_of_pickup_instructions %>
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Date of pick-up</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"><%= setting.event_pickup.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Trees should be ready for pickup starting at</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"><%= setting.event_pickup.strftime("%l:%M%P") %></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
